<title>USA: U.S. vegoil product output/stocks - Census.</title>
<headline>U.S. vegoil product output/stocks - Census.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census Bureau reported selected edible product output as follows (Mln Lbs):</p>
<p>				    Aug 96    Sept 96     Aug 95</p>
<p>   Baking or Frying Fats     545.6     465.4	536.8</p>
<p>   Soy Salad/Cooking Oil     491.9     437.6-R    440.4</p>
<p> Other Salad/Cooking Oil     107.0	90.2-R    118.2</p>
<p>		   Margarine     213.4     170.5	199.8</p>
<p>	   Glycerine Crude	22.9	23.0-R     29.5</p>
<p>		     Refined	25.4	25.6-R     31.8</p>
<p>		 Fatty Acids     150.4     143.0-R    150.4</p>
<p>	 Meat/Meal Tankage     464.4     476.3	503.2</p>
<p>PRODUCER/WAREHOUSE STOCKS OF SELECTED EDIBLE PRODUCTS:</p>
<p>		  (Mln Lbs) --   Aug 96  July 96   Aug 95</p>
<p>    Baking and Frying Fats   109.0     86.8    108.5</p>
<p> Soybean Salad/Cooking Oil    65.2     63.4-R   64.0</p>
<p>   Other Salad/Cooking Oil    31.0     31.4-R   34.8</p>
<p>		     Margarine    44.3     42.3     75.6</p>
<p>	     Glycerine Crude    54.8     56.6-R   24.4</p>
<p>	   Glycerine Refined    18.3     22.0-R   14.6</p>
<p>		   Fatty Acids    87.4    102.6    125.0</p>
